# Website bilingual FR / US

## Helper

```javascript
import { appCopy, prefersEnglish } from "./app-copy.js";

element.textContent = appCopy("Texte FR", "English text");
```

## Rules

- Never ship French-only strings in JS that users see (landing, get-app, referral).
- `get-app-page.js` HTML may default to FR; **must** be overridden in `get-app-mount.js` via `appCopy` on mount.
- Referral clipboard text: always bilingual branches in `referral-link.js`.
- Legal/static pages (`cgu`, `confidentialite`) are FR-only for now — do not mix EN product copy there without a dedicated i18n pass.
